  "schema:comment": [
    "The working-electrode disc built into coin cell 86f18a, punched from electrode batch LFP-NMP-1. LiFePO4 (commercial electrode).",
    "Every figure here is the value metadata.csv publishes for this one cell, not a batch average; the batch averages are on the electrode spec.",
    "Active-material mass 20.6681 mg = coating mass (21.756 mg) x active-material weight percentage (95.0 %), the way metadata.csv derives it. Both factors are structured properties of this record; the product is not, because `mass` is the one curated key that means Mass and a second one would collapse onto it in JSON-LD."
  ],
